<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Biko_(food)> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/type> "merienda,Snack"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Canada> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q6256> .
<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Egg_salad> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Egg salad** is a dish made primarily of chopped [hard-boiled](:Hard-boiled_eggs) or [scrambled eggs](:Scrambled_eggs), [mustard](:Mustard_%28condiment%29), and [mayonnaise](:Mayonnaise), often including other ingredients such as [celery](:Celery).It is made mixed with seasonings in the form of [herbs](:Herb), [spices](:Spices) and other ingredients, bound with mayonnaise. It is similar to [chicken salad](:Chicken_salad), [ham salad](:Ham_salad), [macaroni salad](:Macaroni_salad), [tuna salad](:Tuna_salad),  [lobster salad](:Lobster_meat), and [crab salad](:Crab_meat). A typical egg salad is made of chopped [hard-boiled eggs](:Hard-boiled_egg), [mayonnaise](:Mayonnaise), [mustard](:Mustard_%28condiment%29), minced [celery](:Celery) and [onion](:Onion), [salt](:Edible_salt), [black pepper](:Black_pepper) and [paprika](:Paprika). A common use is as a filling for [egg sandwiches](:Egg_sandwiches). It is also often used as a [Topping](https://recipexzon.blogspot.com/2022/10/egg-salad-sandwich.html) for a [green salad](:Salad%23Green_salad)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
