<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Bolivia> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Bolivia, officially the Plurinational State of Bolivia, is a landlocked country located in western-central South America. The seat of government and executive capital is La Paz, while the constitutional capital is Sucre. The largest city and principal industrial center is Santa Cruz de la Sierra, located on the Llanos Orientales (tropical lowlands), a mostly flat region in the east of the country."@en .
