<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Penteleu> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "***Penteleu*** or ***Cașcaval de Penteleu*** is the name of a [Romanian](:Romanian_cuisine) [cheese](:Cheese) made with [sheep milk](:Sheep_milk), originally from the [Buzău Mountains](:Buz%C4%83u_Mountains) region. It is made using the same process as [caşcaval](:Kashkaval), and can be consumed as a table cheese or it can be used to complement traditional Romanian dishes such as [mămăligă](:M%C4%83m%C4%83lig%C4%83)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
