<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Louis_dressing> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Louis dressing** is a [salad dressing](:Salad_dressing) based on [mayonnaise](:Mayonnaise), to which red [chili](:Chili_pepper) sauce, minced [green onions](:Scallion), and minced green chili peppers have been added. It is commonly used as a dressing for salads featuring seafood, such as a [crab](:Crab) ([Crab Louis](:Crab_Louis), the King of Salads) or [shrimp](:Shrimp) ([Shrimp Louis](:Shrimp_Louis%29)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
