<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Raspberry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The raspberry is the edible fruit of a multitude of plant species in the genus Rubus of the rose family, most of which are in the subgenus Idaeobatus. The name also applies to these plants themselves. Raspberries are perennial with woody stems. World production of raspberries in 2020 was 895,771 tonnes, led by Russia with 20% of the total."@en .
