<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Suffolk_Gold_cheese> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Suffolk Gold cheese** is a semi-soft [cheese](:Cheese) prepared from the [pasteurised](:Pasteurization) [cow's milk](:Cow%27s_milk) of [Guernsey cattle](:Guernsey_cattle). Suffolk Farmhouse Cheeses, a family-operated company located in [Creeting St Mary](:Creeting_St_Mary), [Suffolk](:Suffolk), [England](:England), [produces](:Cheesemaker) the cheese. The [dairy](:Dairy) was established in 2004."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
