<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Bublik> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Bublik** (also *booblik* or *bublyk*; Russian: бублик, [romanized](:Romanization_of_Russian): *búblik*, plural: *bubliki*; Template:Lang-uk is a traditional [Eastern European](:Eastern_Europe) [bread roll](:Bread_roll). It is a ring of yeast-leavened wheat dough, that has been [boiled](:Boiling) in water for a short time before [baking](:Baking)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
