<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Ragusano_cheese> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Ragusano** is an Italian [cow's-milk](:Cow%27s_milk) [cheese](:Cheese) produced in [Ragusa](:Province_of_Ragusa), in [Sicily](:Sicily) in southern Italy. It is a firm stretched-curd (*[pasta filata](:Pasta_filata)*) cheese made with [whole milk](:Whole_milk) from cows of the [Modicana](:Modicana) breed, raised exclusively on fresh grass or hay in the [provinces](:Provinces_of_Italy) of Ragusa and [Syracuse](:Province_of_Syracuse).The cheese was awarded Italian *[Denominazione di Origine Controllata](:Denominazione_di_Origine_Controllata)* protection in 1955 and [EU](:European_Union) [DOP](:Protected_designation_of_origin) status in 1995."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
