<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Penteleu> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Penteleu or Cașcaval de Penteleu is the name of a Romanian cheese made with sheep milk, originally from the Buzău Mountains region. It is made using the same process as caşcaval, and can be consumed as a table cheese or it can be used to complement traditional Romanian dishes such as mămăligă."@en .
