<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Svíčková> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Svíčková**, or **svíčková na smetaně** (pronounced [[ˈsviːt͡ʃkɔvaː na smɛ.ta.ɲɛ]](:Help%3AIPA%29), is a [Czech meat dish](:Czech_cuisine) and one of the most popular [Czech](:Czech_Republic) and Slovak meals. It is [sirloin steak](:Sirloin_steak) prepared with vegetables ([carrots](:Carrot), [parsley](:Parsley) root, [celeriac](:Celeriac) and [onion](:Onion%29), spiced with [black pepper](:Black_pepper), [allspice](:Allspice), [bay leaf](:Bay_leaf) and [thyme](:Thyme), and boiled with [double cream](:Double_cream). It is generally served with *houskové [knedlíky](:Kn%C3%B6del)* (bread [dumplings](:Dumplings%29)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
