<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Bublik> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Bublik (also booblik or bublyk; Russian: бублик, tr. búblik, plural: bubliki; Ukrainian: бублик, romanized: búblyk) is a traditional Eastern European bread roll. It is a ring of yeast-leavened wheat dough, that has been boiled in water for a short time before baking."@en .
