<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Salzburg_(state)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Salzburg (Austrian German: [ˈsaltsbʊʁk], German: [ˈzaltsbʊʁk];Austro-Bavarian: Soizbuag) (also known as Salzburgerland) is a state (Land) of the modern Republic of Austria. It is officially named Land Salzburg to distinguish it from its eponymous capital — the city of Salzburg. For centuries, it was an independent Prince-Bishopric of the Holy Roman Empire."@en .
