<http://dbpedia.org/resource/1Hop> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**1Hop** (formerly, **Top Totty**) is an English [golden ale](:Golden_ale) beer with a 4% alcohol content. It is brewed by [Slater's Ales](:Slater%27s_Ales) in [Staffordshire](:Staffordshire), England. It was initially brewed as a [summer ale](:Summer_ale). It gained nationwide attention after being banned from the [House of Commons](:House_of_Commons_of_the_United_Kingdom)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
