<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Shwe_htamin> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Shwe htamin** (Template:Lang-my; Template:IPA-my, lit. 'golden rice') is a traditional Burmese [dessert](:Dessert) or *[mont](:Mont_%28food%29)*.The dessert consists of [glutinous rice](:Glutinous_rice) cooked with [pandan](:Pandanus_amaryllifolius) leaves, [coconut milk](:Coconut_milk), and [jaggery](:Jaggery), and garnished with fresh [coconut](:Coconut) shavings."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
