<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Mitraillette> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A ***mitraillette*** (Template:IPA-fr, literally \"[submachine gun](:Submachine_gun)\") is a type of [sandwich](:Sandwich) in [Belgium](:Belgium) commonly served at [friteries](:Friterie) and [cafés](:Caf%C3%A9). It is popular among students.It is thought to have originated in [Brussels](:Brussels), but is also popular in [Flanders](:Flanders), [Wallonia](:Wallonia), and the [Nord](:Nord-Pas-de-Calais) region of [France](:France), where it is also known as an \"*Américain*\" (literally an \"American\")."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
