<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Red_bean_ice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Red bean ice** is a drink commonly found in [Hong Kong](:Hong_Kong). It is usually served in restaurants like *[cha chaan teng](:Cha_chaan_teng)*. It is a popular dessert in the summer. The standard ingredients include [adzuki beans](:Adzuki_bean), light [rock sugar](:Rock_candy) [syrup](:Syrup), and [evaporated milk](:Evaporated_milk). It is often topped with [ice cream](:Ice_cream) to become a dessert known as **red bean ice cream** ([traditional Chinese](:Traditional_Chinese_characters): 雪糕紅豆冰; [simplified Chinese](:Simplified_Chinese_characters): 雪糕红豆冰)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
