<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Lamban> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Lamban** is a traditional [dessert](:Dessert) for the [Bruneian Malay people](:Bruneian_Malay_people), [Kedayan](:Kedayan) in [Labuan](:Labuan) and in the [states](:States_and_federal_territories_of_Malaysia) of [Sabah](:Sabah), [Malaysia](:Malaysia). The taste of Lamban is almost like the [Malays](:Ethnic_Malay) [ketupat](:Ketupat) or the Chinese's rice dumplings and [kelupis](:Kelupis) of [Lun Bawang / Lundayeh](:Lun_Bawang)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
