<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Kluai_buat_chi> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Kluai buat chi** or **banana in coconut milk** (Template:Lang-th, Template:IPA-th is a [Thai](:Thai_cuisine) [dessert](:Dessert). Bananas are simply cooked in a mixture of [coconut milk](:Coconut_milk) and coconut cream to create a flavorful dessert. Usually, *Kluai buat chi* is composed of two batters, one salty and one sweet, both of which are cooked in a pot.The dessert is widely served throughout [Thailand](:Thailand) and is popular in neighboring [countries](:Countries) such as [Burma](:Burma), [Laos](:Laos), [Cambodia](:Cambodia), and [Malaysia](:Malaysia). It may be served hot or cold."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
