<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Cake> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Cake is a flour confection made from flour, sugar, and other ingredients, and is usually baked. In their oldest forms, cakes were modifications of bread, but cakes now cover a wide range of preparations that can be simple or elaborate, and which share features with desserts such as pastries, meringues, custards, and pies."@en .
