<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Languedoc> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Languedoc (/ˌlɒ̃ɡ(ə)ˈdɒk/; French: [lɑ̃ɡ(ə)dɔk], locally [lãᵑɡəˈdɔkə]; Occitan: Lengadòc [ˌleŋɡɔˈðɔ(k)]) is a former province of France.Most of its territory is now contained in the modern-day region of Occitanie in Southern France. Its capital city was Toulouse. It had an area of approximately 42,700 square kilometers (16,490 square miles)."@en .
