<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Kuyteav> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "***Kuyteav*** (Template:Lang-km, [UNGEGN](:Romanization_of_Khmer%23UNGEGN): *kŭytéav* Template:IPA-km is a [Cambodian](:Cambodian_cuisine) [noodle soup](:Noodle_soup) consisting of [rice noodles](:Rice_noodles) with pork [stock](:Stock_%28food%29) and toppings. A popular breakfast dish in [Cambodia](:Cambodia), *kuyteav* can be found at marketplace stalls, roadside vendors, restaurants and in [shophouses](:Shophouses) across the country, and is distinguished by its clear broth and array of herbs, aromatics and other garnishes and condiments.*Kuyteav* spread to [Southern Vietnam](:Southern_Vietnam) under the name *Hủ tiếu Nam Vang* (\"[Phnom Penh](:Phnom_Penh) kuyteav\"). In October 2019, *kuyteav Phnom Penh* was recognized as a [collective mark](:Collective_mark) by the Department of Intellectual Property of the [Ministry of Commerce](:Ministry_of_Commerce_%28Cambodia%29)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
