<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Tartar_sauce> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Tartar sauce** (French: *sauce tartare*; spelled **tartare sauce** in the UK, Ireland, New Zealand, Australia, Fiji, South Africa) is a condiment made of [mayonnaise](:Mayonnaise), chopped [pickles](:Pickling) and/or [relish](:Relish), [capers](:Capers) and [herbs](:Herbs) such as [tarragon](:Tarragon) and [dill](:Dill). Tartar sauce can also be enhanced with the addition of other varieties of herbs, [lemon](:Lemon) juice, or [olives](:Olives). It is most often served with [seafood](:Seafood) dishes such as fish and chips, fish sandwiches, fish fingers, fried [oysters](:Oysters) and calamari."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
