<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Gwapyeon> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Gwapyeon (과편; 果片) is a jelly-like hangwa (traditional Korean confection) made with fruits. The colorful fruit jelly is commonly served at banquets. This classic dessert was served in the royal court during the Joseon dynasty."@en .
