<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Louis_dressing> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Louis dressing is a salad dressing based on mayonnaise, to which red chili sauce, minced green onions, and minced green chili peppers have been added. It is commonly used as a dressing for salads featuring seafood, such as a crab (Crab Louis, the King of Salads) or shrimp (Shrimp Louis)."@en .
