<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Cyprus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Cyprus (/ˈsaɪprəs/), officially the Republic of Cyprus, is an island country in the eastern Mediterranean Sea south of the Anatolian Peninsula. Continentally, it is often placed in Western Asia while having cultural and political ties to Southeast Europe. It is the third-largest and third-most populous island in the Mediterranean, and is south of Turkey, east of Greece, and west of Syria. Its capital and largest city is Nicosia."@en .
