<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Gatsby_(sandwich)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A **Gatsby** is a South African [submarine sandwich](:Submarine_sandwich) consisting of a bread roll filled with [chips (French fries)](:French_fries) and a choice of fillings and sauces. It originated in [Cape Town](:Cape_Town) and is popular throughout the [Western Cape](:Western_Cape) province. The sandwich is typically large and shared by several people."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
