<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Lalanga> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Lalanga** is a deep fried [flatbread](:Flatbread) found in [Greek](:Greek_cuisine) and [Turkish cuisines](:Turkish_cuisine). Historically it was present in both [Byzantine](:Byzantine_cuisine) and [Ottoman cuisines](:Ottoman_cuisine)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
