<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Orange_jelly_candy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Orange jelly candy are finger-sized sticks of soft jelly candy generally sold in food specialty stores in Hong Kong. A great deal of candy available in Hong Kong is imported from Europe, mainland China, United States and other regions around the world. Orange jelly candy is one of the few that have historically been manufactured locally in Hong Kong."@en .
