<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Whipped_cream> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Whipped cream** is [liquid](:Liquid) [heavy cream](:Heavy_cream) that is whipped by a [whisk](:Whisk) or [mixer](:Mixer_%28cooking%29) until it is light and fluffy and holds its shape, or by the expansion of [dissolved gas](:Dissolved_gas), forming a firm [colloid](:Colloid). It is often [sweetened](:Sweetened), typically with [white sugar](:White_sugar), and sometimes flavored with [vanilla](:Vanilla). Whipped cream is also called **Chantilly cream** (or **crème Chantilly**; Template:IPA-fr."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Anglo-Soviet_invasion_of_Iran> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/Event> .
