<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Suffolk_Gold_cheese> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Suffolk Gold cheese is a semi-soft cheese prepared from the pasteurised cow's milk of Guernsey cattle. Suffolk Farmhouse Cheeses, a family-operated company located in Creeting St Mary, Suffolk, England, produces the cheese. The dairy was established in 2004."@en .
