<http://dbpedia.org/resource/An-doughnut> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**An-doughnut** ([Japanese](:Japanese_language): あんドーナツ, [Romaji](:Romanization_of_Japanese): *an-dōnatsu*) is a Japanese [doughnut](:Doughnut) filled with [red bean paste](:Red_bean_paste). It is a confection created in Japan, along with [anpan](:Anpan), Jam pan, cream pan, [curry bread](:Curry_bread), and many others. It is unknown when an-doughnut was created in Japan. However, [Mister Donut](:Mister_Donut) in Japan added an-doughnuts to its menu in December 1983."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
