<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Orange_jelly_candy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Orange jelly candy** are finger-sized sticks of soft jelly candy generally sold in food specialty stores in [Hong Kong](:Hong_Kong). A great deal of candy available in Hong Kong is imported from [Europe](:Europe), [mainland China](:Mainland_China), [United States](:United_States) and other regions around the world. Orange jelly candy is one of the few that have historically been manufactured locally in Hong Kong."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
