<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Blueberry_pie> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Blueberry pie** is a [pie](:Pie) with a [blueberry](:Blueberry) filling. Blueberry pie is readily made because it does not require pitting or peeling of fruit. It usually has a top and bottom [crust](:Pastry). The top crust can be circular, but the pie can also have a crumble crust or no top crust. Blueberry pies are often eaten in the summertime when [blueberries](:Blueberry) are in season in the [Northern hemisphere](:Northern_hemisphere)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
