<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Tortas_de_aceite> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Torta de aceite**, is a light, crisp and flaky sweet [biscuit](:Biscuit) in the shape of a [torta](:Torta).The main ingredients are [wheat flour](:Wheat_flour), [olive oil](:Olive_oil), [almonds](:Almond), [sugar](:Sugar), [sesame seeds](:Sesame_seed), [anise seeds](:Anise_seed) and anise flavor.The true origin of the olive oil tortas is unknown. On one hand, it is said that they come from an ancient Arab recipe, it is also said that olive oil torta was a traditional sweet created in southern Spain."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
