<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Zōni> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Zōni (雑煮 or ぞうに), often with the honorific \"o-\" as o-zōni, is a Japanese soup containing mochi rice cakes. The dish is strongly associated with the Japanese New Year and its tradition of osechi ceremonial foods. The preparation of zōni varies both by household and region."@en .
<http://dbpedia.org/resource/France> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <http://dbpedia.org/resource/List_of_French_monarchs> .
