<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Elenski_but> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Elenski but** (Template:Lang-bg or (more precisely but less commonly) бут по еленски, sometimes translated as *Elena round* or *Elena leg*) is a [dry-cured](:Curing_%28food_preservation%29) [ham](:Ham) from the town of [Elena](:Elena_%28town%29) in northern [Bulgaria](:Bulgaria) and a popular delicacy throughout the country. The [meat](:Meat) has a specific taste and can be preserved in the course of several years, owing much to the special process of making and the climatic conditions of the part of [Stara Planina](:Stara_Planina) where Elena is located."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
