<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Frozen_dessert> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Frozen dessert** is a [dessert](:Dessert) made by freezing liquids, semi-solids, and sometimes even solids. They may be based on flavored water ([shave ice](:Shave_ice), [ice pops](:Ice_pop), [sorbet](:Sorbet), [snow cones](:Snow_cone%29), on fruit purées (such as [sorbet](:Sorbet%29), on [milk](:Milk) and [cream](:Cream) (most [ice creams](:Ice_cream%29), on [custard](:Custard) ([frozen custard](:Frozen_custard) and some ice creams), on [mousse](:Mousse) ([semifreddo](:Semifreddo%29), and others. It is sometimes sold as ice-cream in South Asia and other countries."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
