<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Sárgatúró> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Sárgatúró** (in literal translation: \"yellow curd cheese\") is a [Hungarian](:Hungary) [Easter](:Easter) delicacy, prepared mostly in [Eastern Catholic](:Eastern_Catholic_Churches) regions, notably in [Szabolcs-Szatmár-Bereg County](:Szabolcs-Szatm%C3%A1r-Bereg_County) and in the [Hajdúság](:Hajd%C3%BAs%C3%A1g)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
